# m3_loop: m3_boss's input for 2000 ticks: after the 120-tick breather the table restarts
# (phase 0 at 1103) and stage 2 enemies spawn again. With the F2 from the boss's crate (841)
# and the F3 collected at 1416 the stage-2 8 s beetle (HP 5) spawns at 1583 and dies at
# 1602, dropping crate 4 (until M6 the zapper took until ~1697, so 1690 was pinned).
--frames 2000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "32 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_stage,debug_phase,debug_enemies --at "1300 debug_phase == 0" --at "1415 debug_weapon == 2" --at "1416 debug_weapon == 3" --at "1590 debug_enemies > 0" --at "1601 debug_drops == 3" --at "1602 debug_drops == 4" --expect "debug_stage == 1" --expect "debug_state == 1"
